    </div>

    <div class="terms-card">
        <h2>4. Pricing & Payments</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>All prices are listed in INR unless specified</li>
            <li>Applicable taxes will be charged as per Indian law</li>
            <li>Payments must be completed before service activation</li>
            <li>Subscription services may renew automatically (if applicable)</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-card">
        <h2>5. Refund Policy</h2>
        <p>
            There is no refund available on purchasing online, self-paced courses, or live courses.
        </p>
        <p>
            Unlike physical goods, digitally delivered services cannot be recalled once accessed or downloaded.
