        <p>
            Our website may contain links to third-party platforms such as payment gateways or external websites.
            We are not responsible for their services, privacy policies, or practices.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-card">
        <h2>9. Termination Rights</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate user access if:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Terms are violated</li>
            <li>Fraud or suspicious activity is detected</li>
            <li>Legal compliance requires action</li>
