        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-card">
        <h2>12. Log Files</h2>
        <p>
            EDU Payman follows a standard procedure of using log files including IP address,
            browser type, ISP, date/time stamp, referring pages, and click counts for analytics purposes.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-card">
        <h2>13. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>
            We use cookies to improve user experience and analyze website performance.
            Users can disable cookies in browser settings.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-card">
        <h2>14. Children’s Information</h2>
        <p>
            We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13.
            If such data is identified, it will be removed promptly.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="terms-card">
        <h2>15. Online Policy Scope</h2>
        <p>
            These terms apply only to online activities and do not apply to offline services unless specified.
        </p>
